# Agent Instructions

This project uses `project-skills` for workflow tracking.

As an AI agent operating in this project, you must:
1. Ensure `.ai-workflow` is initialized. If not, inform the user to run `python path/to/project-skills/scripts/workflow.py init`.
2. Record user prompts manually via `record-prompt` if automatic hooks are unavailable.
3. Log meaningful actions and completions using the `log` command.
4. Keep the `HANDOFF.md` updated. It will automatically regenerate every 3 interactions, but you can trigger it manually with `handoff`.

Remember to always respect the privacy constraints and do not bypass the redaction script.
